{
    "background_story": "Estrella was a free-spirited artist with a mischievous twinkle in her eye. Growing up in a small village, she was always getting into trouble, whether it was sneaking into the local market to taste exotic fruits or convincing her friends to join her in a midnight swim in the nearby lake. As she grew older, Estrella's rascality only intensified, leading her to become a master of playful pranks and clever heists. She once famously 'borrowed' a valuable painting from the village museum, only to return it with a cleverly added mustache, leaving the curator both baffled and amused. Estrella's antics earned her a reputation as the village troublemaker, but also made her a beloved figure, always pushing boundaries and keeping life interesting.",
